      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُفَرَّجٌ</span></b>  A camel (O) <i>whose elbow is distant from
his armpit:</i> (O, K:) or <i>wide in step:</i> (O:) or,
with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ة</span>, a she-camel <i>whose elbows are far from
her chest, and whose armpits are</i> [<i>therefore</i>] <i>wide.</i>
(Ham p. 783.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <i>A comb.</i> (O, K.)

